       }
      ],
      "text": "Depression:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " many adolescents don't present w classic adult sxs; irritability or pervasive boredom may be sxs; parents often don't know about suicidal thoughts or attempts, so question the adolescent directly if any concern."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
