      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Puberty:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " reassure parents that most breast development in boys = normal and temporary, and asymmetrical breast development in females = normal; educate girls and parents about menarche, cycle length, hygiene, dysmenorrhea, and irregular bleeding."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
